# Git LFS
#
# /sect scene packs: gzip-compressed meshopt GLBs written by
# blender/xianxia-sect/tools/sect_pack.py (full/ high tier + full/low/ phone
# tier, about 184 MB in 55 files). Every repack rewrites them and they can't
# be diffed, so they live in LFS instead of the normal git history.
# The JSON beside them (manifest, meta, camera, clouds, flyer) stays a normal
# file because client tests read it. The tests only check that each pack
# exists, so CI passes with LFS pointer files (no `lfs: true` checkout needed).
client/public/sect/**/*.glb.gz filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
